---
---

<section class="py-20">
  <div class="section-container max-w-5xl">
    <div class="material-card p-8 sm:p-12 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Subtle gradient background -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e3f2fd]/50 via-transparent to-[#bbdefb]/30 dark:from-[rgba(33,150,243,0.08)] dark:to-[rgba(33,150,243,0.05)] pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#e3f2fd] dark:bg-[rgba(33,150,243,0.15)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-[#2196f3] dark:text-[#64b5f6]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#212121] dark:text-[#f5f5f5] mb-3">订阅我的实践笔记</h2>
        <p class="text-[#757575] dark:text-[#9e9e9e] mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
          每周分享技术见解、项目心得和学习资源。无垃圾邮件，随时取消订阅。
        </p>

        <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('订阅功能即将上线！');">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="输入你的邮箱地址"
            class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1e1e] border border-[#e0e0e0] dark:border-[#333333] text-[#424242] dark:text-[#e0e0e0] text-sm placeholder:text-[#9e9e9e] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2196f3]/20 focus:border-[#2196f3] transition-all"
            required
          />
          <button type="submit" class="material-btn material-btn-primary whitespace-nowrap">
            立即订阅
          </button>
        </form>

        <p class="text-xs text-[#9e9e9e] dark:text-[#757575] mt-4">
          通过订阅，你同意接收我的最新文章和项目更新
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
